# Resolver Pattern

Chain-dispatched operations follow this layout:

feature/
  resolver.ts     # Type definition
  index.ts        # Router (Record<ChainKind, Resolver>)
  resolvers/
    evm.ts        # EVM implementation
    bitcoin.ts    # Bitcoin implementation

Router uses Record<ChainKind, Resolver> with satisfies for exhaustiveness.
Each resolver file handles exactly one chain family.
Adding a new chain: add resolver file + add entry to Record (compiler enforces completeness).

Current state uses type guards (isEvmChain, isBitcoinChain) which works for 2 chains.
Target: migrate to resolver pattern as chains are added.
